    },
    {
      "name": "Greek extra-virgin olive oil",
      "amount": "2 tablespoons",
      "notes": "For serving"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "In a blender or food processor, combine mustard seeds, lemon juice, garlic, dill, parsley, zucchini, and red onion. Blend until smooth.",
    "Strain the mixture through a fine-mesh sieve into a bowl, pressing on the solids to extract as much liquid as possible. Discard the solids.",
    "Let the mixture sit at room temperature for 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "Just before serving, drizzle the mixture with olive oil and stir to combine.",
    "Serve the velvety fresh Greek mustard immediately, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
  ],
